{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A narrative-focused <strong>psychological horror</strong> game about <strong>possessed computers</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/1e1344e261f1711f432ce75dc64a4bbe.avif?t=1765233211\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras_big/1e1344e261f1711f432ce75dc64a4bbe.avif?t=1765233211 width=800 height=549 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lonely, but never alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The computer glares at you, humming incessantly. There is no peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/243ed14d14cde0c3eab78e79a1e652f2.poster.avif?t=1765233211\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/243ed14d14cde0c3eab78e79a1e652f2.webm?t=1765233211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/243ed14d14cde0c3eab78e79a1e652f2.mp4?t=1765233211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modern computers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the 2000s! The state of the art, Bindows Millenium computers can\u2019t wait to take you to the new age of productivity!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/8bc99963628a437fd94e80f718bbff3f.poster.avif?t=1765233211\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/8bc99963628a437fd94e80f718bbff3f.webm?t=1765233211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/8bc99963628a437fd94e80f718bbff3f.mp4?t=1765233211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Liminal Reality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie empty rooms and hallways, where the traces of life are but a haunting memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/508e605507db29d0e6197b72753605e7.poster.avif?t=1765233211\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/508e605507db29d0e6197b72753605e7.webm?t=1765233211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/508e605507db29d0e6197b72753605e7.mp4?t=1765233211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search into the past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story of a former game studio, exploring<strong> </strong>for clues in an office that, somehow, is still alive, as computers and lights remain awake for a Monday that will never arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/1cd49aa2274471c89147d5572ec99ea6.avif?t=1765233211\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras_big/1c